{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I only remember the noise, the screaming, and then. Silence and blood...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the accident, I woke up in some dark wasteland where time had stopped, and the world looked like it had been dying for centuries. I looked for help, for a way out. For any sign of life. But what I found was... different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can feel the darkness everywhere. Not the ordinary kind... it's heavy, suffocating, alive. I have this feeling something is watching me. Maybe it's this place. Maybe it's those... creatures. Demons? I don't know. I don't want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another crumbling corridor, traps, and... who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer with environmental puzzles, arcade elements, and secret artifacts to discover. This game puts a strong emphasis on atmosphere. 18 levels, no dialogue, no hints, you have to discover everything on your own.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Artifact 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845560/ce5a256b306a828faed805324186abdb6cc53971.jpg"},{"name":"Artifact 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845560/6d82c2199212f9b7c001aa86cb1cb89cfe2e1563.jpg"},{"name":"Artifact 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845560/d82618713aa91d376984a2f1ff56df3a26790ae1.jpg"},{"name":"Artifact 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845560/3080cc18ed6f838d762eb84f9c4db6b71e6455c6.jpg"},{"name":"Artifact 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845560/135a19071c6fbe906ce23369deecb6bdaee4e1dd.jpg"},{"name":"Artifact 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3845560/f4309d2aace