 it's those... creatures. Demons? I don't know. I don't want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another crumbling corridor, traps, and... who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer with environmental puzzles, arcade elements, and secret artifacts to discover. This game puts a strong emphasis on atmosphere. 18 levels, no dialogue, no hints, you have to discover everything on your own.</p>","developers":["Preycom"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845560/94acc87f853ee25680106cdd53592dd90669a428/header.jpg?t=1761057871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 core 64-bit procesor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or other shader model 4.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mavericks 10.9 or later required<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Mac OS X Snow Leopard 10.6.3 lub nowszy<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845560/886696512/7da0db305da679e2552f770c56ffebb13c3900e9/1753733050/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753734093","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845560/886696512/7da0db305da679e2552f770c56ffebb13c3900e9/1753733050/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753734093","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vide